## wd2l audit rule for the Quadlet unit, Enclave 2 receiver host (docs/deployment/containers.md).
## Only where Podman is installed: auditd refuses a watch whose directory is missing
## (/etc/containers/systemd), and augenrules stops loading rules there.
## Copy to /etc/audit/rules.d/wd2l-quadlet.rules, then: sudo augenrules --load
-w /etc/containers/systemd/wd2l-receiver.container -p wa -k wd2l-units
